{
 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.11.0",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Friends can join by scanning a QR code: Settings > Invite people > Join with a QR code. They type their name, e-mail and a password on their own phone, and they're in (the code works for 30 minutes, up to 10 people, and you can stop it).",
  "Gemini Fast is the default for chats and note summaries: the quickest Gemini first, usually about a second. Pick Gemini Smart in a chat's model menu (or Smarter Gemini notes in Settings > AI) for harder things.",
  "One Check Gemini (Settings > AI) is enough to put the quickest model first, and a busy model goes to the back at once.",
  "Copying on your phone reaches your PC and Chromebook: open Vault after copying, or Share > Vault, or the icon's Send clipboard. Keep this clipboard in step is now on by default."
 ],
